/// every indicator. It no longer draws any component: the controls take the
/// choices' roles; focus, tabs and plain text buttons follow the web; and
/// links, the picked day and the rest take their own colours. Tertiary
/// is left unset, so Material falls back to secondary, and the copper stays a
/// token for whoever wants it.
///
/// The neutrals are the web's slate: every grey below comes from
/// [DibaLightNeutrals] and [DibaDarkNeutrals], which map the roles as the
/// web's `themes/diba/variables.css` does.
